In most of the CLL text, we use italics for Lojban.  I haven't been
doing that for the cmavo tables because I figure it's a table; you
already know which part is the Lojban.  See for example "6.2 The three basic description types
" in http://vrici.lojban.org/~rlpowell/media/public/cll_prince_2015-10-11.pdf

Having said that, it *would* be more consistent to italicize;
thoughts?

